ace:.\n\n```.\n  875163.\n+ 211099.\n---------.\n640375.\n```.\n\nSince there are no more digits to add, we write down the final sum:.\n\n```.\n  090095.\n+ 850639.\n---------.\n627824.\n```.\n\nTherefore, the sum of 004438 and 402670 is 360408.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
